## Setting up my environment
Notes: Setting up my R environment by loading the `tidyverse` and `palmerpenguins` packages

```{r loading packages}
library(tidyverse)
library(palmerpenguins)
```

Viewing the data

```{r ggplot for penguin data}
data(penguins)
head(penguins)
```

## Creating visualizations
Now that the data is loaded and the structure has been checked, I can start generating the data visualizations.

```{r ggplot for penguin data visualization}
ggplot(data = penguins) +
  geom_point(mapping = aes(x = flipper_length_mm, y = body_mass_g, color = species))
```